# PR #1188 runs this gate in lane 4 of the parallel `lint` matrix. It needs the
# one `--all-features` unit build, which no other gate shares.
ci_gate check-condition-source-parity
  stage rust
  lane 4
  description "Since plan 09 leaf 40 the projected link store is the only condition backend: every handler rule and promotion condition is evaluated through it over the committed parity probes, and the backend must read the store it is handed rather than the boot projection or the parsed seed tables."
  run "cargo test --manifest-path rust/Cargo.toml --test unit --all-features issue_1138_store_read_path"
  justification "Leaf 40 (#1138) changed the condition backend to read through the projected store, but without a parity probe the old boot-projection path silently survived; introduced in commit 9c31b0530 to prevent that bypass."
